+ 8 = 0</p><p>x&#178; = -7x - 8</p><p>Substitute x&#178; = -7x - 8 into (x&#178; - 5x + 8):</p><p>x&#178; - 5x + 8 = (-7x - 8) - 5x + 8</p><p>=&gt; -7x - 5x - 8 + 8</p><p>=&gt; -12x</p><p>So, the denominator becomes -12x.</p><p>The expression becomes : </p><p>(4x)/(x&#178; - 5x + 8) = (4x)/(-12x)</p><p>=&gt; 4/-12 = -1/3</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If a -&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">a - 5</span></div>&nbsp;= 10, then the value of (a - 5)<sup>3</sup> -&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">(a - 5)<sup>3</sup></span></div>&nbsp;is:&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a - <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">a - 5</span></div> = 10 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (a - 5)<sup>3</sup> - <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; pad