value of a +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">a</span></div>&nbsp;is :&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a<sup>3</sup> +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">a<sup>3 </sup></span></div>&nbsp;= 2 (a &gt; 0), &#2340;&#2379; a +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">a</span></div>&nbsp; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;:</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>a<sup>3</sup> + 1/a<sup>3</sup> = 2</p><p>(a + 1/a)<sup>3</sup> = a<sup>3 </sup>+ 1/a<sup>3</sup> + 3(a + 1/a)</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> = 2 + 3x</p><p>where x = a + 1/a</p><p>rearrange the equation : </p><p>x<sup>3</sup>  -  3x  -  2 = 0</p><p>(x  -  2)(x<sup>2</sup> + 2x + 1) = 0</p><p>Solving x<sup>2</sup> + 2x + 1 = 0</p><p>(x + 1)<sup>2</sup> = 0 =&gt; x = - 1</p><p>Since a &gt; 0, we discard x = -1 and we take</p><p>a + 1/a = 2</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If x<sup>2</sup> + 1 = x , then the value of x<sup>12</sup> + x<sup>6</sup> + 1 is:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x<sup>2</sup> + 1 = x , &#2340;&#2379; x<sup>12</sup> + x<sup>6</sup> + 1 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>When, x&#178; + 1 = x</p><p>Then,</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> = -1</p><p>x<sup>6</sup> = 1 </p><p>x<sup>9</sup> = -1</p><p>x<sup>12</sup> = 1 </p><p>Given, x&#178; + 1 = x</p><p>x<sup>12</sup> + x<sup>6</sup> + 1 = 1 + 1 + 1 = 3</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If x +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x</span></div>&nbsp;= 7 where x &gt; 0, the positive value of x -&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x</span></div>&nbsp;is:&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x</span></div>&nbsp;= 7 &#2332;&#2361;&#2366;&#2306; x &gt; 0, x &#2325;&#2366; &#2343;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2325; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344;  x -&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x</span></div>&nbsp;&nbsp; &#2361;&#2376;:</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">5&radic;4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5&radic;4</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">5&radic;5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5&radic;5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3&radic;5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3&radic;5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4&radic;5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4&radic;5</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Here, (x+1/x)=7</p><p>We know that : (x+1/x)<sup>2</sup> = (x-1/x)<sup>2</sup> + 4</p><p>So putting the value of (x+1/x) as 7, we get:-</p><p>7<sup>2</sup> = (x-1/x)<sup>2</sup> + 4</p><p>49-4= (x-1/x)<sup>2</sup></p><p>So, (x-1/x) =&radic;45= &radic;9*5 =3&radic;5</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;Let 3t -&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">3t</span></div>&nbsp;= 3, then which of the following expressions has the value equal to 12?&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2354;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; 3t -&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">3t</span></div>&nbsp;= 3, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; 12 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;?</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">9t<sup>2</sup> + 1/9t<sup>2</sup> + 2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">9t<sup>2</sup> + 1/9t<sup>2</sup> + 2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">9t<sup>2</sup> + 1/9t<sup>2</sup>  -  2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">9t<sup>2</sup> + 1/9t<sup>2</sup>  -  2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">9t<sup>2</sup> + 1/9t<sup>2</sup> + 1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">9t<sup>2</sup> + 1/9t<sup>2</sup> + 1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">9t<sup>2</sup> + 1/9t<sup>2</sup></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">9t<sup>2</sup> + 1/9t<sup>2</sup></span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>(a - b)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2</sup> - 2ab + b<sup>2</sup></p><p>3t - 1/3t = 3</p><p>Squaring both side</p><p>9t<sup>2</sup> + 1/9t<sup>2</sup> - 2 = 9</p><p>9t<sup>2</sup> + 1/9t<sup>2</sup> = 11</p><p>According to question, </p><p>Put the value 9t<sup>2</sup> + 1/9t<sup>2</sup> = 11 in option (c)</p><p>9t<sup>2</sup> + 1/9t<sup>2</sup> + 1</p><p>=&gt; 11 + 1 = 12</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If x = 7  -  4&radic;3, then find the value of x<sup>2</sup> +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>2</sup></span></div></div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&nbsp;&#2351;&#2342;&#2367;  x = 7  -  4&radic;3, &#2340;&#2379; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;   x<sup>2</sup> +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>2</sup></span></div></div></p><p></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">188</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">188</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">194</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">194</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">186</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">186</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">196</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">196</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>Conjugate of x = 7 + 4&radic;3</p><p>x  X  (7 + 4&radic;3) = (7 - 4&radic;3)(7 + 4&radic;3)</p><p>=&gt; x  X  (7 + 4&radic;3) = 49 - (4&radic;3)<sup>2</sup></p><p>=&gt; 49  -  48 = 1</p><p>=&gt; 1/x = 7 + 4&radic;3</p><p>x + 1/x = (7 - 4&radic;3) + (7 + 4&radic;3)</p><p>=&gt; x + 1/x = 7 + 7 = 14</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> = (x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> - 2</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> = 14<sup>2</sup> - 2</p><p>=&gt; 196  -  2 = 194</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If x = 11, then the value of (x<sup>5</sup> - 12x<sup>4</sup> + 12x<sup>3</sup> - 12x<sup>2</sup> + 12x - 1) is:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x = 11 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (x<sup>5</sup> - 12x<sup>4</sup> + 12x<sup>3</sup> - 12x<sup>2</sup> + 12x - 1) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">10</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">10</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">8</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">9</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">9</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">14</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">14</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>x = 11 </p><p>x<sup>5</sup> - 12x<sup>4</sup> + 12x<sup>3</sup> - 12x<sup>2</sup> + 12x  -  1</p><p>= 11<sup>5</sup>  -  12 * 11<sup>4</sup> + 12 * 11<sup>3</sup>  -  12 * 11<sup>2</sup> + 12 * 11  -  1</p><p>= 11<sup>5</sup>  -  11 * 11<sup>4</sup>  -  11<sup>4</sup> + 11 * 11<sup>3</sup> + 11<sup>3</sup>  -  11 * 11<sup>2</sup>  -  11<sup>2</sup> + 11 * 11 + 11 - 1</p><p>= 11<sup>5</sup>  -  11<sup>5</sup>  -  11<sup>4</sup> + 11<sup>4</sup> + 11<sup>3</sup>  -  11<sup>3</sup>  -  11<sup>2</sup> + 11<sup>2</sup> + 11 - 1</p><p>= 11  -  1</p><p>= 10</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If x &gt; 1 and x<sup>2</sup> +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>2</sup></span></div>&nbsp;= 83, then x<sup>3</sup>  -&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>3</sup></span></div>&nbsp;= ?&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x &gt; 1 &#2324;&#2352; x<sup>2</sup> +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>2</sup></span></div>&nbsp;= 83, &#2347;&#2367;&#2352; x<sup>3</sup>  -&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>3</sup></span></div>&nbsp;= ?&nbsp;</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">884</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">884</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">876</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">876</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">754</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">754</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">756</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">756</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>Given, (x + 1/x)&#178; = 83</p><p>x&#178; + 1/x&#178; - 2 = 83 - 2</p><p>(x - 1/x)&#178; = 9&#178;</p><p>Using the formula:</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> - 1/x<sup>3</sup>  = (x + 1/x)  X  (x&#178; + 1/x&#178; + 1)</p><p>=9(83+1)</p><p>=756</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If x<sup>4</sup> + x<sup>-4</sup> = 47, x &gt; 0, then what is the value of x +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x</span></div>&nbsp;- 2&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x<sup>4</sup> + x<sup>-4</sup> = 47, x &gt; 0, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; x + <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x</span></div> - 2</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>x<sup>4</sup> + x<sup>-4</sup> = 47</p><p>x<sup>4</sup> + 1/x<sup>4</sup> = 47</p><p>(x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup>  -  2 = 47</p><p>(x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> = 49</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> = 7</p><p>(x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup>  -  2 = 7</p><p>(x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> = 9</p><p>x + 1/x = 3</p><p>x + 1/x  -  2 = 3  -  2 = 1</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>(x<sup>8</sup> + 1)</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>x<sup>4</sup></span></div> = 14, then the value of <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>(x<sup>12</sup> + 1)</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>x<sup>6</sup></span></div> is &#58;&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>(x<sup>8</sup> + 1)</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>x<sup>4</sup></span></div> = 14, &#2340;&#2379;<div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>(x<sup>12</sup> + 1)</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>x<sup>6</sup></span></div> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;:</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">16</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">16</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">14</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">14</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">52</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">52</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">64</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">64</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p><img width=76 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22631/image100.png\"></p><p><img width=84 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22631/image101.png\"></p><p>By adding 2 on both sides:</p><p><img width=129 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22631/image102.png\"></p><p><img width=103 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22631/image103.png\"></p><p><img width=76 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22631/image104.png\"></p><p>By taking cube on both sides:</p><p><img width=169 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22631/image105.png\"></p><p><img width=115 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22631/image106.png\"></p><p><img width=84 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22631/image107.png\"></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">x</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>2</sup> - 2x + 1</span></div>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">3</span></div>&nbsp;, then find the value of x<sup>3</sup> +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>3</sup></span></div></div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&nbsp;&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">x</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>2</sup> - 2x + 1</span></div>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">3</span></div>&nbsp;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;   x<sup>3</sup> +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>3</sup></span></div></div></p><p></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">110</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">110</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">130</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">130</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">160</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">160</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">180</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">180</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>If x/(x&#178; - 2x + 1) = 1/3, then find the value of x&ge; + 1/x&ge;.</p><p>Recognize that x&#178; - 2x + 1 = (x - 1)&#178;. The equation becomes:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;x/(x - 1)&#178; = 1/3.</p><p>Multiply both sides by (x - 1)&#178;:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;x = (x - 1)&#178;/3.</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;Then multiply by 3:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;3x = (x - 1)&#178;.</p><p>Expand (x - 1)&#178;:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;3x = x&#178; - 2x + 1.</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;Rearrange to form a quadratic:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;x&#178; - 5x + 1 = 0.</p><p>Divide the quadratic by x (x &#8800; 0):</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;x - 5 + 1/x = 0, which gives:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;x + 1/x = 5.</p><p>Use the identity:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;(x + 1/x)&ge; = x&ge; + 1/x&ge; + 3(x + 1/x).</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;Substitute x + 1/x = 5:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;125 = x&ge; + 1/x&ge; + 15.</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;Thus, x&ge; + 1/x&ge; = 125 - 15 = 110.</p><p>Option (a) is the correct answer.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If x<sup>2</sup> + 6x + 1 = 0, then the value of (x + 6)<sup>3</sup> + <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>(x + 6)<sup>3 </sup></span></div> = &quest;&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x<sup>2</sup> + 6x + 1 = 0 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (x + 6)<sup>3</sup> + <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>(x + 6)<sup>3 </sup></span></div> = ? &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">245</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">245</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">216</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">216</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">186</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">186</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">198</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">198</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>From the equation:</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + 6x + 1 = 0</p><p>x(x + 6) = -1</p><p>x = -1/(x + 6) ......... (1)</p><p>x + 1/x = -6 ........ (2)</p><p>By taking cube on equation (2):</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + 1/x<sup>3</sup> = (-6)<sup>3</sup>  -  3 * (-6)</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + 1/x<sup>3</sup> = -198 ........ (3)</p><p>By putting the value of 'x' from equation (1) in equation (3):</p><p><img width=175 height=63 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22631/image109.png\"></p><p><img width=159 height=45 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22631/image110.png\"></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If a +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">a</span></div>&nbsp;= 7&radic;3, then what is the value of (a<sup>6</sup> + a<sup>-6</sup>) ?&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a + <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">a</span></div>&nbsp;= 7&radic;3, &#2340;&#2379; (a<sup>6</sup> + a<sup>-6</sup>) &nbsp; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</div></div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">3048190</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3048190</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3048542</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3048542</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3048132</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3048132</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3048625</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3048625</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Here,</p><p>(a+1/a)=7&radic;3</p><p>On Squaring both sides we get:</p><p>a<sup>2</sup>+1/a<sup>2</sup>+2=147</p><p>a<sup>2</sup>+1/a<sup>2</sup>=145</p><p>so:</p><p>we know by formula of (a+b)<sup>3</sup>=a<sup>3</sup>+b<sup>3</sup>+3ab(a+b)</p><p>(a<sup>2</sup>+1/a<sup>2</sup>)<sup>3</sup>=a<sup>6</sup>+1/a<sup>6</sup> +3(a<sup>2</sup>+1/a<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>(145)<sup>3</sup>= a<sup>6</sup>+1/a<sup>6</sup> +3*145</p><p>So, (a<sup>6</sup> + a<sup>-6</sup>)=3048190.</p><p>Option (a) is the correct answer.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If x<sup>2</sup>  -  3x + 1 = 0, then the value of ( x<sup>4</sup> + <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>x<sup>2</sup></span></div> ) &div; ( x<sup>2</sup> + 1 ) is:&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x<sup>2</sup> - 3x + 1 = 0 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; ( x<sup>4</sup> + <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>x<sup>2</sup></span></div> ) &div; ( x<sup>2</sup> + 1 ) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;:</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">9</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">9</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">6</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">6</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">7</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  3x + 1 = 0</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + 1 = 3x</p><p>x + 1/x = 3 --------(1)</p><p>By taking cube on both sides:</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + 1/x<sup>3</sup> + 3(x + 1/x) = 27</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + 1/x<sup>3</sup> = 18 --------(2)</p><p>Now, the value of (x<sup>4</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup>) &div; (x<sup>2</sup> + 1)</p><p>= x(x<sup>3</sup> + 1/x<sup>3</sup>) &div; x(x + 1/x)</p><p>= 18 &div; 3 = 6</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If x +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x</span></div>&nbsp;= 2, then find (x<sup>4</sup> +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">4</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>4</sup></span></div>&nbsp;)(x<sup>3</sup> -&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">4</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>3</sup></span></div>&nbsp;)&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&nbsp;If x +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x</span></div>&nbsp;= 2, then find (x<sup>4</sup> +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">4</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>4</sup></span></div>&nbsp;)(x<sup>3</sup> -&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">4</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>3</sup></span></div>&nbsp;)&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">-15</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-15</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">15</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">15</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-10</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-10</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">10</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">10</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>x + 1/x = 2</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + 1 = 2x</p><p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  2x + 1 = 0</p><p>(x  -  1)<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>x  -  1 = 0</p><p>x = 1</p><p><img width=267 height=45 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p28235/image065.png\"></p><p>= (1 + 4)(1  -  4)</p><p>= 5*(-3)</p><p>= -15</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If x(x  -  5) = -1, then the value of x<sup>3</sup>(x<sup>3</sup>  -  110) = ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x(x - 5) = -1 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; x<sup>3</sup>(x<sup>3</sup> - 110) = ? &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>x(x  -  5) = -1</p><p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  5x = -1</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + 1 = 5x</p><p>x + 1/x = 5</p><p>(x + 1/x)<sup>3</sup> = 5<sup>3</sup></p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + 1/x<sup>3</sup> + 3(x + 1/x) = 125</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + 1/x<sup>3</sup> + 3 * 5 = 125</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + 1/x<sup>3</sup> + 15 = 125</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + 1/x<sup>3</sup> = 110</p><p>x<sup>6</sup> + 1 = 110x<sup>3</sup></p><p>x<sup>6</sup>  -  110x<sup>3</sup> = -1</p><p>x<sup>3</sup>(x<sup>3</sup>  -  110) = -1</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If x +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x</span></div>&nbsp;= 15, then the value of&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">7x<sup>2</sup> - 9x + 7</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>2</sup> - x + 1</span></div></div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&nbsp;&#2351;&#2342;&#2367;  x +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x</span></div>&nbsp;= 15, &#2340;&#2379; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;  &nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">7x<sup>2</sup> - 9x + 7</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>2</sup> - x + 1</span></div></div></p><p></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">-48/7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-48/7</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-22/7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-22/7</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">48/7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">48/7</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">22/7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">22/7</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>If </p><p>x + 1/x = 15</p><p>x <sup>2</sup> + 1 = 15x</p><p>Now,</p><p>(7x<sup> 2</sup>  -  9x + 7)/(x <sup>2</sup>  -  x + 1)</p><p>= [7(x<sup> 2</sup> + 1)  -  9x]/(x <sup>2</sup> + 1  -  x)</p><p>= (7*15x  -  9x)/(15x  -  x)</p><p>= (105  -  9)/14</p><p>= 96/14</p><p>= 48/7</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If x +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x</span></div>&nbsp;= 2, then find the value of x<sup>2723</sup> +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>3836</sup></span></div></div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&nbsp;&#2351;&#2342;&#2367;  x +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x</span></div>&nbsp;= 2, &#2340;&#2379; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;   x<sup>2723</sup> +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x<sup>3836</sup></span></div></div></p><p></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-1</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>The given equation x + 1/x = 2 suggests that x might be a value satisfying this equation. The solution to this equation can be obtained by recognizing that it is a form of the identity for the cosine of an angle.</p><p>In fact, the equation x + 1/x = 2 holds when x = 1, because : </p><p>1 + 1/1 = 2</p><p>Substituting x = 1 into the expression x<sup>2723</sup> + 1/x<sup>3836</sup> gives : </p><p>x<sup>2723</sup> + 1/x<sup>3836</sup> = 1 + 1 = 2</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If x +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">9x</span></div>&nbsp;= 3, then find 9x<sup>2</sup> +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">9x<sup>2</sup></span></div></div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&nbsp;&#2351;&#2342;&#2367;  x +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">9x</span></div>&nbsp;= 3, &#2340;&#2379; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;   9x<sup>2</sup> +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">9x<sup>2</sup></span></div></div></p><p></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">87</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">87</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">81</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">81</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">77</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">77</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">79</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">79</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>x+(1/9x) = 3</p><p>multiply both sides by 3 we get,</p><p>3x + 1/3x = 9</p><p>Squaring both sides we get,</p><p>9x<sup>2</sup> + 1/9x<sup>2 </sup>+ 2 * 3x * 1/3x = 81</p><p>9x<sup>2</sup> + 1/9x<sup>2</sup> = 79</p>","marks":2,"section":null}]}